00:13:07.744 --> 00:13:09.844
Seeker: baddest boots.

00:13:09.844 --> 00:13:11.084
Kenzo: I think I've got shoes.

00:13:11.084 --> 00:13:12.524
Kenzo: Um, actually, it's a good question.

00:13:12.524 --> 00:13:13.564
Kenzo: I throw darts, right?

00:13:14.864 --> 00:13:16.524
Kenzo: I do have some range weapons.

00:13:16.524 --> 00:13:17.684
DM: Yeah, you have darts.

00:13:17.684 --> 00:13:18.554
Wellby: Can I... Hey, Tim.

00:13:18.554 --> 00:13:18.584
DM: Yeah.

00:13:18.584 --> 00:13:21.644
Delwath: Can I trade in... Like, so I have a chained shirt.

00:13:21.644 --> 00:13:21.804
DM: Yep.

00:13:21.804 --> 00:13:24.404
