00:13:24.404 --> 00:13:27.964
DM: Yeah, sure. You can get half its, half its selling price.

00:13:27.964 --> 00:13:29.344
Seeker: Trade in. Nice.

00:13:34.124 --> 00:13:34.364
Kenzo: Um,

00:13:36.784 --> 00:13:36.944
Kenzo: huh.

00:13:39.404 --> 00:13:42.124
Kenzo: Good question of what gear we're gonna need for this journey.

00:13:42.124 --> 00:13:42.644
Seeker: Hmm.

00:13:43.764 --> 00:13:44.504
Seeker: Are we gonna ride

00:13:46.604 --> 00:13:48.284
Seeker: animals?

00:13:48.284 --> 00:13:50.024
Seeker: Do we know how to do that?

00:13:50.024 --> 00:13:50.554
Kenzo: Feels like that was part-

00:13:50.554 --> 00:13:51.244
Wellby: Yeah, you have a horse.

00:13:52.284 --> 00:13:52.304
Wellby: [laughs]

00:13:52.304 --> 00:13:53.254
