00:13:53.254 --> 00:13:53.264
Wellby: Pretty good.

00:13:53.264 --> 00:13:54.624
DM: The rest of you know how to ride.

00:13:54.624 --> 00:13:56.724
DM: I mean, uh.

00:13:56.724 --> 00:13:57.704
Kenzo: Yeah, we should all get horses.

00:13:59.344 --> 00:13:59.504
DM: The,

00:14:02.624 --> 00:14:08.204
