01:40:37.820 --> 01:40:44.440
DM: is contemplating leaving in the next day or two, fleeing west into the...

01:40:44.440 --> 01:40:47.740
DM: fleeing from what is not entirely clear.

01:40:50.080 --> 01:40:53.300
DM: But whatever it is, it seems horrifying.

01:40:54.820 --> 01:40:57.520
