01:41:46.280 --> 01:41:49.260
DM: and Jeevali will be with us in this journey and keep us safe."

01:41:50.420 --> 01:41:53.900
DM: And with that, the fires burn down to the ground,

01:41:55.680 --> 01:42:05.920
