01:56:52.344 --> 01:57:02.014
DM: Um, so that one just, like, falls down, just, like, face plants in the, in the sand, like, between one step and the next.

01:57:03.544 --> 01:57:04.364
DM: Uh, bonus action?

01:57:06.184 --> 01:57:08.784
