01:59:02.493 --> 01:59:02.493
DM: Gotcha.

01:59:02.493 --> 01:59:08.183
Seeker: Usually after the creature rolls the bardic inspiration die, to add it to an attack roll, it's thunder-based attack.

01:59:13.184 --> 01:59:13.834
DM: So it does nothing then.

01:59:13.834 --> 01:59:15.844
