01:59:24.144 --> 01:59:26.344
DM: You get the original one and this effect.

01:59:26.344 --> 01:59:36.824
DM: So if you add the bardic inspiration to an attack roll, then every creature within five feet of you has to succeed on a constitution

01:59:36.824 --> 01:59:43.044
