01:59:45.924 --> 01:59:46.184
Seeker: Okay.

01:59:46.184 --> 01:59:52.014
DM: So when you use it to attack, it explodes, doing thunder damage, basically, to whatever you attacked.

01:59:52.014 --> 01:59:52.024
DM: Um-

01:59:52.024 --> 01:59:54.944
